# Research (docs/re-party-chat.md): find the menu path that starts script 018 (0x0205F350); run with --save
include boot_from_save
wait 250
exec 0x0205F350 menu_018
exec 0x02020170 field_018
press X 3
wait 70
watch u8 0x02139FD5 screen
touch 48 133 4
wait 90
touch 222 120 4
wait 60
shot i_1
touch 222 120 4
wait 90
shot i_2
press A 3
wait 90
shot i_3
press A 3
wait 90
shot i_4
press A 3
wait 90
shot i_5
